um Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; word-break: break-all;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 14pt;\">3. </span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림; font-weight: bold; font-size: 14pt;\">수강신청 접속방법 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 14pt;\">(2026</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림; font-weight: bold; font-size: 14pt;\">학년도 신입생</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 14pt;\">) <span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt;\">※ 신입생 학번부여 일정(예정): 8. 3.(월)&nbsp;</span></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding: 0px; line-height: 30.4px; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: 굴림; font-size: 12pt;\">가</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림; font-size: 12pt;\">우리대학교 홈페이지 통합정보시스템에서 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">ID</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림; font-size: 12pt;\">와 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">Password</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림; font-size: 12pt;\">를 등록하여야 합니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 0px 32.6pt; padding: 0px; line-height: 30.4px; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; word-break: break-all; text-indent: -32.6pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: -0.1pt; font-size: 12pt;\">나</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: -0.1pt; font-size: 12pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: -0.1pt; font-size: 12pt;\">수강신청은 학생이 우리대학교 홈페이지</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: -0.1pt; font-size: 12pt;\">(http://www.kumoh.ac.kr)</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: -0.1pt; font-size: 12pt;\">에 접속하여 </span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: -0.1pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 255);\">대학원 수강신청 배너창</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: -0.1pt; font-size: 12pt;\">을 이용하여 로그인 한 후 자신이 수강할 과목을 전산 입력 후 저장하고</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: -0.1pt; font-size: 12pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: -0.1pt; font-size: 12pt;\">종료하여야 수강신청이 완료됨</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: -0.1pt; font-size: 12pt;\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding: 0px; line-height: 30.4px; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: 굴림; font-size: 12pt;\">다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">. ID </span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림; font-size: 12pt;\">및 비밀번호 등록</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">/</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림; font-size: 12pt;\">변경</span><u><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">(</span></u><u><span style=\"font-family: 굴림; font-size: 12pt;\">통합정보시스템 구</span></u><u><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">)</span></u><u><span style=\"font-family: 굴림; font-size: 12pt;\">원스톱서비스 </span></u><u><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">ID, Password</span></u><u><span style=\"font-family: 굴림; font-size: 12pt;\">와 동일</span></u><u><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">)</span></u></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding: 0px; line-height: 30.4px; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; word-break: break-all;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">1) ID : </span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림; font-size: 12pt;\">자신의 학번을 등록한다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding: 0px; line-height: 30.4px; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; word-break: break-all;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">2) </span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림; font-size: 12pt;\">비밀번호 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">: </span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림; font-size: 12pt;\">주민등록번호 뒷자리 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">7</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림; font-size: 12pt;\">자리 숫자 또는 본인이 조합하여 등록한다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 0px 54.9pt; padding: 0px; line-height: 30.4px; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; word-break: break-all; text-indent: -54.9pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">☞ </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: -0.1pt; font-size: 12pt;\">ID</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: -0.1pt; font-size: 12pt;\">와 비밀번호는 자신의 모든 학적사항</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: -0.1pt; font-size: 12pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: -0.1pt; font-size: 12pt;\">수강신청</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: -0.1pt; font-size: 12pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: -0.1pt; font-size: 12pt;\">성적조회</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: -0.1pt; font-size: 12pt;\">)</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: -0.1pt; font-size: 12pt;\">에 사용되므로 유출되지</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 0px 54.9pt; padding: 0px; line-height: 30.4px; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; word-break: break-all; text-indent: -54.9pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 굴림; font-size: 12pt;\">않도록 유의하여야 합니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 0px 54.9pt; padding: 0px; line-height: 30.4px; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; word-break: break-all; text-indent: -54.9pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">※ </span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림; font-weight: bold; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">재학생은 기존의 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">ID</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림; font-weight: bold; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">와 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">Password </span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림; font-weight: bold; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">동일</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 0px 54.9pt; padding: 0px; font-size: 11pt; line-height: 27.8667px; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; word-break: break-all; text-indent: -54.9pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span><